abstract: >-
  Interactive atlas of the Greek dialects attested in the oracular lead
  lamellae of Dodona, the digital companion to the PhD thesis "Las
  variedades dialectales de las laminillas oraculares de Dodona"
  (Universidad de Valladolid, in preparation). It covers the 4,418 texts of
  I.Dodone DVC and I.Dodone Lhôte, of which 1,455 carry dialect features,
  and presents for each dialect group its attribution criteria and degree
  of certainty, chronology, maps of place names and ethnics, linguistic
  features with the inscriptions that attest them, and the list of
  inscriptions, together with the notes of the author's autopsy of 71
  lamellae. Its data are derived from the thesis chapters and research
  database by generators that check the figures against the database.
  Content is licensed CC BY-NC-ND 4.0 and code MIT.
